  <Strings>
    <Section>Story</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>10452</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C4901</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Kunzite&gt;は
見ただけで相手のデータが
わかるって本当なのか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Kunzite&gt;, is it true you can read data
on things just by looking at them?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>10664</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C4902</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>肯定。
例えば、&lt;Kohaku&gt;の
データならば——</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Affirmative. For example,
if I were to analyze &lt;Kohaku&gt;'s data―</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>11280</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C4903</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>え……何、&lt;Kunzite&gt;？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Kunzite&gt;?
Wh-What are you doing?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>11740</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C4904</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>動くな。&lt;Shing&gt;へ
提供する&lt;Kohaku&gt;の
肉体データを取得中だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Please remain still.
I am in the process of acquiring data
pertaining to your body to share with &lt;Shing&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>12000</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C4905</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ちょっ……やだ、うそ！
信じらんないッ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wait, what?! No!
I can't believe you guys!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>14348</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C4906</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ぐッ……デ、データ取得完了。
&lt;Kohaku&gt;の平均キック力は
１８万５千ギガスゴ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Urk... D-Data acquisition complete.
The average force of &lt;Kohaku&gt;'s
kicks are... 185,000 gigasgo...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>15200</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C4907</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……り、了解。
それが１８万５千ギガスゴの
ダメージなんだね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>G-Got it.
So that's the kinda damage
185,000 gigasgo can do...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
